F | Glow **ON**, HDR 2D OFF | Glow OFF, HDR 2D **ON** | Glow **ON**, HDR 2D **ON**\r\n-|-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ecbcec3d-e32b-44f0-9acd-94f3699efda0\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97d30504-c2c1-49f8-8b80-6f210696ec74\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25a9ee17-c7c0-4e90-a1c6-3a46d2e74cf5\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65f1b61b-8594-4d39-8733-6362ed682a76\" />\r\n\r\n#### With transparent background\r\n\r\n*Transparent background doesn't seem to work in saved images when HDR 2D is enabled, but that's a separate issue. It displays correctly on Linux/X11 at least.*\r\n\r\nGlow OFF, HDR 2D OFF | Glow **ON**, HDR 2D OFF | Glow OFF, HDR 2D **ON** | Glow **ON**, HDR 2D **ON**\r\n-|-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ddd916a-06b6-4c2d-8425-f3144fec0063\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea34f897-b2e6-4b99-a133-642b56e2f4dc\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0243a478-737a-4de4-81a1-0aaf6139f39c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c561e4a3-9eef-4b83-b49e-d4a760983c1a\" />","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109404#pullrequestreview-5531284385","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109404","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109404#pullrequestreview-5531284385"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109404"}},"submitted_at":"2026-10-15